        value = 0.704 if token == '\n' else 2.108
    elif token == '\ufe0f':  # Emoji presentation variation selector.
        value = -1.85
    elif token == '··' and (position == 0 or previous == '··'):
        value = -0.735

    return (doc, position + 1, (tail + token)[-100:], token), value

"""A lexical detector for open-ended lists and their unspecified members.

It recognizes 'and other', 'etc.', 'and so on', 'or the like', and related
expressions, including some translations. Quantifiers, conjunctions and
recent commas modify their strength. It keeps only 100 characters of history,
reset at document boundaries. Unrecognized tokens predict zero. This is a
phrase heuristic, not a general parser of enumerations.
