"""A transliterated 'om' detector, including o|m across token boundaries.

Short, word-internal fragments and -oma/-ome/-omic-shaped endings are
strongest. Common whole words and word-initial tokens are weaker. There is
also a small carry-over to a following subword, and a spaced-ellipsis response.
The mathematical homom- prefix has a separate negative response. Constants
are category averages estimated from training examples.
