After the initial run, predict zero until the next document. Burst size is
estimated from familiar token classes: whitespace, digits, heading/comment
marks, source-code openers, and words. Leading spaces and English grammatical
classes modulate word sizes. Arbitrary token-specific variation is not modeled.
